{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloudbreaker</strong> is a roguelite survivors-like where you explore a sky-world, defeating hordes of enemies. Upgrade and optimize your arsenal with an <strong>inventory management puzzle system</strong>. <strong>Unlock and upgrade airships</strong>, each with its own unique layout, abilities, and strategies, to grow your power over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp;\u00a0Survive:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2b181e1ebb09c843327919b357737423.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2b181e1ebb09c843327919b357737423.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve down through the clouds into a sky-world rife with danger and riches. <strong>Discover</strong>\u00a0<strong>ruins</strong>\u00a0filled with scrap, relics, and resources to power up your ship. <strong>Survive against hordes</strong> of <i>Biotes</i>\u2014the lingering biotech experiments of past civilizations. <strong>Defeat bosses</strong> to gain the power to break through deeper cloud layers and descend deeper into the depths of the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/247ae643fd6acad373f4087b4be94b80.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/247ae643fd6acad373f4087b4be94b80.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>survive</strong>, you must carefully <strong>upgrade your ship</strong> to contend with increasing dangers as you descend. Defeating <i>Biotes</i> earns you <i>Bloil</i> that your ship converts into <i>Engine Parts</i>. These <i>Engine Parts</i> can be installed in your <i>Engine Grid</i>\u2014an<strong>\u00a0inventory management</strong>\u00a0puzzle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f3ee67de83ec464e80f955f34d489253.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f3ee67de83ec464e80f955f34d489253.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placement of<strong>\u00a0</strong><i>Engine Parts</i>\u00a0is key. Each <i>Engine Part</i> interacts with the grid in unique ways, creating <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. This forces you to carefully consider where each new part is installed, and plan your build accordingly. Weapons also have their own <strong>upgrade trees</strong>, redefining how they function, adding another layer of depth to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrive:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2a2c03c41d4fbee869e34d27e285bea4.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2a2c03c41d4fbee869e34d27e285bea4.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power grows over time as you <strong>unlock new parts and airships</strong>. Each ship has its own unique <i>Engine Grid</i> layout, and abilities, that lend themselves to new strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you will customize each ship by powering its upgrade tree, tailoring it to your particular playstyle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sky-world, discovering ruins and surviving waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management style <i>Engine Grid</i> puzzle system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <i>Engine Parts</i> that can <strong>combine</strong>\u00a0and <strong>connect to\u00a0</strong>create\u00a0<strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discoverable relics</strong> that change combat, opening up new strategies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable airships</strong> with unique layouts, and abilities for varied playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade trees</strong> for each ship, enabling deep customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> and <strong>mini-bosses</strong> that will test your skills and builds.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620890?t=1770393427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/653b3269cdb4df2f1dfabd9a0e84e30f3ddb92bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770393427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/2c08ded329f2dfeb928ee340fb7ec1591c6eff39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770393427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/2c08ded329f2dfeb928ee340fb7ec1591c6eff39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770393427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloudbreaker</strong> is a roguelite survivors-like where you explore a sky-world, defeating hordes of enemies. Upgrade and optimize your arsenal with an <strong>inventory management puzzle system</strong>. <strong>Unlock and upgrade airships</strong>, each with its own unique layout, abilities, and strategies, to grow your power over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp;\u00a0Survive:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2b181e1ebb09c843327919b357737423.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2b181e1ebb09c843327919b357737423.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve down through the clouds into a sky-world rife with danger and riches. <strong>Discover</strong>\u00a0<strong>ruins</strong>\u00a0filled with scrap, relics, and resources to power up your ship. <strong>Survive against hordes</strong> of <i>Biotes</i>\u2014the lingering biotech experiments of past civilizations. <strong>Defeat bosses</strong> to gain the power to break through deeper cloud layers and descend deeper into the depths of the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/247ae643fd6acad373f4087b4be94b80.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/247ae643fd6acad373f4087b4be94b80.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>survive</strong>, you must carefully <strong>upgrade your ship</strong> to contend with increasing dangers as you descend. Defeating <i>Biotes</i> earns you <i>Bloil</i> that your ship converts into <i>Engine Parts</i>. These <i>Engine Parts</i> can be installed in your <i>Engine Grid</i>\u2014an<strong>\u00a0inventory management</strong>\u00a0puzzle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f3ee67de83ec464e80f955f34d489253.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/f3ee67de83ec464e80f955f34d489253.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placement of<strong>\u00a0</strong><i>Engine Parts</i>\u00a0is key. Each <i>Engine Part</i> interacts with the grid in unique ways, creating <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. This forces you to carefully consider where each new part is installed, and plan your build accordingly. Weapons also have their own <strong>upgrade trees</strong>, redefining how they function, adding another layer of depth to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrive:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2a2c03c41d4fbee869e34d27e285bea4.poster.avif?t=1770393427\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/extras/2a2c03c41d4fbee869e34d27e285bea4.webm?t=1770393427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power grows over time as you <strong>unlock new parts and airships</strong>. Each ship has its own unique <i>Engine Grid</i> layout, and abilities, that lend themselves to new strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you will customize each ship by powering its upgrade tree, tailoring it to your particular playstyle</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sky-world, discovering ruins and surviving waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management style <i>Engine Grid</i> puzzle system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <i>Engine Parts</i> that can <strong>combine</strong>\u00a0and <strong>connect to\u00a0</strong>create\u00a0<strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discoverable relics</strong> that change combat, opening up new strategies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable airships</strong> with unique layouts, and abilities for varied playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade trees</strong> for each ship, enabling deep customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> and <strong>mini-bosses</strong> that will test your skills and builds.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ballast Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620890/f5a92c2f55384c943d71ff90a31d25e07f6bbd8c/header.jpg?t=1770393427","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.6.24</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.6.24</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620890/1528510967/6580c0fd6882f173a08fcc4fbf6ef37e6f6cce96/1766070536/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766071525","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620890/1528510967/6580c0fd6882f173a08fcc4fbf6ef37e6f6cce96/1766070536/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766071525","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620890/1528510967/6580c0fd6882f173a08fcc4fbf6ef37e6f6cce96/1766070536/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766071525","id":257227946,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227946/57fee7f4b4d74afffcf640fb438e3918779d9ef7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766071525"}],"name":"Cloudbreaker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Ballast Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","